WEBVTT

00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,160
Is it possible that I am doing too much soda?

00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:20,800
Well, it's always possible that we do too much of anything, except maybe prayer.

00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:30,240
But yes, too much of a good thing can be a bad thing. So I don't know what how much soda this person who asked the question is doing,

00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,960
but I remember several years ago, I had a gal who was doing

00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:39,920
three 30 minute sauna sessions a day trying to help her detox.

00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:46,000
And she was sweating profusely on each sauna. Is that too much?

00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,920
Well, I don't know. I mean, every human being is different.

00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:57,440
So I wouldn't even say that there is a number that we can assign to what is too much

00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:05,720
sauna and how we could define that. Everybody's different. I suppose it partly depends on, you know, how much do you weigh?

00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:12,440
And, you know, are you, you know, are you losing weight doing the soda?

00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:15,480
Are you losing too many electrolytes doing the soda?

00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:20,880
Certainly, you have to get argue that there's people that work outside in

00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:27,520
Southern climate in the heat and are sweating like a pig for eight hours a day,

00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:33,000
laying block or something like that. You can't say, oh, is that too much sweating?

00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:41,880
Well, the whole purpose of a sauna is to create a, you know, a detox portal through your skin by you sweating.

00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:47,480
So can you do that too much? Well, you could, you know,

00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:53,080
end up dehydrated because you're losing too many of your electrolytes so that you can't hold your water.

00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:59,840
So if you are doing too much sauna, you got to make sure that you're resupplying to

00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:06,200
electrolytes. And, you know, it depends on the definition of this.

00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:13,080
So typically if a person's doing sauna 30 minutes every day, that's not too much sauna,

00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:17,440
but even at that, anything could be too much for an individual, depending on their weight.

00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:22,720
And, um, and if they're in a state of cakesia and they're losing weight,

00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:28,640
all these kind of things factor into that. So you have to use some common sense in this.

00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:33,320
If you are doing it three times a day and you're sweating profusely,

00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:38,640
maybe you need to add, you know, add minerals, some electrolytes to your diet to help

00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:42,520
supplement that, um, that might be a good thing to do.

00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:49,440
But in general, you can't really do too much sauna, unless you're obviously, you know,

00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,560
overdoing it in other ways.

